```bash lucio command=execute show_source=false stdout=false stderr=false
# hidden block to ensure a certain queue is playing
volumito playlist play "volumito test qobuz multiple albums"
```

## Inspect The Current Queue

### Queue List

Command `queue list` lets you query the contents
of the current playback queue:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue list
```

### Queue Status

If you want to know the details of the item currently playing,
use `queue status`:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue status
```

Add `--fields ALL` for even more details:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue status --fields ALL
```
